.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH bap-add 1  "bap-add " 
.SH NAME
bap\-add \- Add packages to package.json and install them
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbap\-add\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISPECS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add packages to package.json and install them
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISPECS\fR>
Package specs, e.g. left\-pad, @scope/pkg@^2
